---
import StaticPage from '../layouts/StaticPage.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config/site';
---

<StaticPage path="/contact/" h1="Contact Opus Calculator" updated="2026-11-23">
  <p class="mt-6">
    The best way to reach the site is email: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email.general}`}>{SITE.email.general}</a>. There is no contact form, so nothing you type is
    sent anywhere until you press send in your own email program.
  </p>

  <h2>What gets a reply</h2>
  <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
    <li>
      <strong>A result that looks wrong.</strong> Tell us the calculator, the exact numbers you typed, the answer you got and the answer you expected. A wrong
      result is the most important thing we can fix, and corrections are logged as described in the <a href="/editorial-policy/">editorial policy</a>.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>A formula or wording question,</strong> for example "why is this rounded this way". Questions about how a calculator works are answered and often
      become a clearer explanation on the page.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>An accessibility barrier.</strong> Write to <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email.accessibility}`}>{SITE.email.accessibility}</a>, as described in the
      <a href="/accessibility/">accessibility statement</a>. We reply within {SITE.respondWithinBusinessDays} business days.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>A copyright notice.</strong> Follow the steps on the <a href="/dmca/">DMCA page</a> and write to{' '}
      <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email.dmca}`}>{SITE.email.dmca}</a>.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>A privacy request</strong> to see, delete or move data about you. Use the general address and say "privacy request" in the subject. See the{' '}
      <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a>.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>A suggestion for a new calculator.</strong> We read every one. We cannot promise a date, because new pages are added in stages.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What does not get a reply</h2>
  <p>
    We do not give personal financial, medical, legal or tax advice, so please do not send questions about your own situation. We also do not reply to offers of
    paid links, guest posts or link exchanges.
  </p>

  <h2>How long it takes</h2>
  <p>This is a small independent site. Corrections to a wrong result are handled first. Other messages usually get a reply within a few working days.</p>
</StaticPage>
